                      "fill": "$faint",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Prompt, the palette kitterm already has. kitterm.dev defines --accent #3fb950; it is the favicon chevron, the blinking caret, and favicon.ts calls it connected. Three hues carry the page: green for alive, amber for needs you, red for failed. Done goes grey, because a finished thing needs nothing. Closest pair 52 degrees, the widest of any palette drawn.",
