                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Four quadrant frames at 90 ms, the terminal's own spinner. The page tries braille first, the frames Claude Code turns in the pane, then the quadrant, then the block ramp the chart already proves; it takes the first whose advance width matches the mark column. It replaces the accent mark on any line whose agent holds the tty. Nothing else on the page moves. Under prefers-reduced-motion the cycle stops and the mark rests full.",
