              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Measured in OKLCh: accent 183°, needs-you 87°, failed 35°. The closest pair is 52° with a 15.6 lightness gap. Charcoal is a mid tone, so it takes the hairline; the ground is #050c10, L* 14.8, which keeps its slate-teal cast at a fifth of its lightness.",
